(UUID(), 'UI/UX & Product Design', 'ui-ux-product-design', 'Human-centered design systems, interactive prototypes, and conversion-focused digital interfaces.', 'Create products users love. Our UI/UX designers map user journeys, build interactive prototypes, design design systems, and optimize conversion funnels to ensure your business goals are met with elegance.', 'Layout', '["Figma","Prototyping","Design Systems","User Research","Wireframing"]', 'UI/UX Design Agency | TechInPedia India', 'Custom digital product UI/UX design, interactive prototyping, and design system engineering.', 4, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(3), NOW(3))
