(UUID(), 'E-Commerce Solutions', 'ecommerce-solutions', 'Custom, high-converting e-commerce platforms with multi-currency checkout and inventory management.', 'Drive sales with custom e-commerce stores designed for speed, security, and effortless checkout experiences. Features include payment gateway integration, real-time inventory tracking, and custom admin dashboards.', 'ShoppingBag', '["Next.js","Node.js","MySQL","Stripe","Razorpay","Tailwind CSS"]', 'E-Commerce Web Development | TechInPedia India', 'Build high-converting custom e-commerce stores with Next.js and secure payment integrations.', 5, 'PUBLISHED', NOW(3), NOW(3))
